:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"length_cm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">94</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tol_cm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"materials\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shell\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"spec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"单面汗布 180gsm 棉/氨纶 95/5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PANTONE 19-4052\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"trim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"spec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2cm 罗纹领口\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"同色\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"operations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"seq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sewing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"instruction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"四线包缝侧缝，针距 3.0mm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"seq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sewing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"instruction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"领口罗纹双针绷缝\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"seq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pressing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"instruction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"整烫定型，蒸汽压力 0.4MPa\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"critical_points\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"领口拉伸回复率 ≥ 90%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"色差 ΔE ≤ 1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>技术包里的 <code>critical_points</code> 是连接加工与质量的接口——它在打样阶段就把「什么算合格」写清楚，这样产前样确认时双方有客观依据，而不是靠目测争论。这些关键点在量产阶段会成为在线质检的采集项，两处必须用同一套编码，见<a href=\"../quickresponse-quality-ops/fastturn-quality-inline\">快反在线质检与返工</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最小起订量的成本结构\">最小起订量的成本结构</h2><p>工厂不愿意接 50 件的单子，不是因为它嫌麻烦，而是因为一笔<strong>固定成本</strong>必须被摊薄。这笔固定成本由几块构成：机器换款的停线损失（下一节详述换款本身）、版房出样的工时、面料的起订与最小缸量、以及首件确认与产前样的质量成本。摊薄方式决定了单件成本随批量下降的曲线形状。</p>\n<p>设一次订单的固定准备成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，单件可变成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，批量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，则单件成本为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>S</mi><mi>Q</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(Q) = v + \\frac{S}{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条曲线在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 很小时陡峭下降，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 较大时趋于平坦。它解释了两个现象：一是「起订量」本质上是一个成本可接受性阈值，不是一个物理限制——工厂能接 50 件，只是要价会高；二是当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 被压缩时，曲线整体下移且更早变平，小批量在经济上才真正可行。所以<strong>降低最小起订量的根本手段是压缩固定准备成本</strong>，而不是去说服工厂「通融一下」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[固定准备成本 S] --&gt; B[换款停线损失]&#10;  A --&gt; C[版房出样工时]&#10;  A --&gt; D[面料起订与最小缸量]&#10;  A --&gt; E[首件确认与产前样]&#10;  B --&gt; F[S 压缩后单件成本曲线下移]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[可接受的最小起订量下降]&#10;  G --&gt; H[更小的首单]\">graph TD\n  A[固定准备成本 S] --&gt; B[换款停线损失]\n  A --&gt; C[版房出样工时]\n  A --&gt; D[面料起订与最小缸量]\n  A --&gt; E[首件确认与产前样]\n  B --&gt; F[S 压缩后单件成本曲线下移]\n  C --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[可接受的最小起订量下降]\n  G --&gt; H[更小的首单]</pre><h3 id=\"面料起订是隐藏的大头\">面料起订是隐藏的大头</h3><p>四块固定成本里，<strong>面料起订量</strong>往往最不受平台控制，也最容易被低估。面料厂的染缸有最小容量，一次开缸的成本是固定的，所以面料商设最小起订量；如果平台要的独家花型只有这一款用，这个起订量就被摊到这款上，可能直接把首单量顶到几百件。</p>\n<p>破解思路有三条，按代价从低到高：<strong>用现货面料</strong>（牺牲独特性换速度）、<strong>多款共用一缸</strong>（把几个款的用量凑够最小缸量，代价是几个款必须同时确认面料与颜色）、<strong>提前备料</strong>（把面料从订单周期里拿出去，这属于第三章的备料协同）。三条路在平台侧表现为不同的「首单可选模式」，让商品团队按款的战略重要性选择，而不是让所有款都走同一条路。</p>\n<h3 id=\"首单量的决策\">首单量的决策</h3><p>首单量本身是一个决策变量，它太大则库存风险高，太小则试不出统计意义且缺货窗口长。它的合理起点是<strong>能够维持一个可观测窗口的销量</strong>：如果平台的判断周期是 5 天，目标是这 5 天的预期销量能被首单覆盖，那么首单量应约等于 5 天预期日销；至于预期销量本身怎么估、以及追单量怎么算，见<a href=\"hotstyle-chase-reorder\">爆款追单与交期压缩</a>中的报童模型。这里只需记住：首单量与追单量不是两个独立决策，首单跨度越短，追单频率越高，系统对需求信号的响应越快，但每次追单的固定准备成本也越多次被支付。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加速首单的工程手段\">加速首单的工程手段</h2><p>把首单周期从三周压到一周，靠的不是催工厂，而是改流程结构。有效的手段集中在三处。</p>\n<p><strong>并行化样品轮次。</strong> 初样与修样可以用两批面料同时启动——初样验证版型结构，同时另一条线用主面料试色与缩率。版型确定后，产前样直接沿用主面料，不必重做版型。这样三轮变两轮半。</p>\n<p><strong>面料前置与预留。</strong> 首单面料在打样阶段就向面料商预留产能，而不是等样衣确认后才下料单。代价是可能备错（款最终没选上），收益是周期缩短数天。</p>\n<p><strong>版房产能的池化。</strong> 平台的打样不一定由接单工厂自己做。集中式的打样中心（服务多个工厂）能摊薄版师成本并提高版房利用率，代价是版型与工厂工艺的耦合需要额外沟通。这是「打样与制造解耦」的一种形态，它把打样变成一个可并行的独立环节。</p>\n<h3 id=\"首单的评价指标\">首单的评价指标</h3><p>首单做完了要有度量，否则无法判断流程改进是否有效。两个核心指标：<strong>首单周期</strong>（从款确认上线到首单入库的天数）与<strong>首单命中率</strong>（首单后触发追单的款占全部试销款的比例）。前者衡量速度，后者衡量选品质量。两者要一起看——只提速度不看命中率，会诱使平台把首单量压到极低、试销款数暴增，最终总成本更高。命中率这个指标与第四章的协同 KPI 有交集，两者的口径需要统一，见<a href=\"../quickresponse-quality-ops/agile-supply-kpi\">柔性供应链协同 KPI</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>打样通常经初样、修样、产前样三轮，压缩空间来自并行化与面料前置，而非催促。</li>\n<li>版房是最常见的打样瓶颈，必须作为独立产能资源登记（工序组含 <code>pattern</code>）。</li>\n<li>技术包是打样的输入契约，必须包含款式图、尺寸表、物料规格、工艺说明与关键质量点。</li>\n<li>最小起订量的本质是固定准备成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的摊薄阈值，公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(Q)=v+S/Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>；降低起订量的根本手段是压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>面料最小缸量常是被低估的固定成本大头，破解路径为现货面料、多款共缸、提前备料。</li>\n<li>首单量起点约为一个观测窗口的预期销量，且与追单量是同一决策的两个部分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>首单发出去之后，真正的快反才开始——什么时候追、追多少、怎么把追单的交期压到最短，见<a href=\"hotstyle-chase-reorder\">爆款追单与交期压缩</a>；而如果连首单的周期都压不下来，问题往往出在整条工序链的时间结构上，见<a href=\"quickresponse-leadtime-cut\">快反周期压缩与并行准备</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"小批量打样与快速首单","id":"小批量打样与快速首单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：打样要经过的几轮","id":"核心概念-打样要经过的几轮"},{"level":3,"text":"版房是第一个瓶颈","id":"版房是第一个瓶颈"},{"level":3,"text":"从设计稿到技术包的标准化","id":"从设计稿到技术包的标准化"},{"level":2,"text":"最小起订量的成本结构","id":"最小起订量的成本结构"},{"level":3,"text":"面料起订是隐藏的大头","id":"面料起订是隐藏的大头"},{"level":3,"text":"首单量的决策","id":"首单量的决策"},{"level":2,"text":"加速首单的工程手段","id":"加速首单的工程手段"},{"level":3,"text":"首单的评价指标","id":"首单的评价指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工厂工艺能力与适配品类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/agile-quickresponse-supply-chain/factory-capacity-visibility/capability-process-mapping"},"next":{"title":"爆款追单与交期压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/agile-quickresponse-supply-chain/small-batch-quick-response/hotstyle-chase-reorder"}}